{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1ed2a23487170e38b33f84dfd359c639566d6151ba999cbf913a1b36ee184d32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea76ec5d895d57c30e2ad2c94a8a79f444f39cac45e8f3416a831fef3f13ebe7",
      "text": "清晨的市场真是有趣呢！\n谢谢您带我过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b833e68e44ea420f95b1cd0739e353477122655fb0bd2db72246e27b75657e",
      "text": "您能乐在其中便比什么都好。\n真不愧是这座渔港才独有的丰富鱼类品种呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c48d3dfd8f3d26c639e3f2147df65e88c876d62bc2f7a895edfae7dcb739cfc0",
      "text": "还有。今天我还为您准备了另一份礼物。\n请收下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edc35d23cb6220eeb02c66ada054d9522ed30568afe5e831a9747934f6df66c8",
      "text": "色彩非常艳丽的小物件呢。\n材质看起来好像很罕见的样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8ae63799ea353fd02df6b89bfb4a76adb764c388ba6bd6250c34ebd180b95b7",
      "text": "那个是用海洋塑料回收制作而成的小物件哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11db922eac07f4da6dc6c5cc16fb39a94ba810047bdb6940abed96ee8bfd1945",
      "text": "作为原料的那些海洋塑料，在最终送达制作人的手边之前，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241f231cd2e87d18c7c0f1c46b452468d089415a8569eaa89cfb3a607ab0ae4a",
      "text": "说不定曾在许多海域中冒险呢。\n这样一想，是不是就很令人兴奋？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18304036eb7935ff2f9ae381ff66347b0cabd077e2329610296216bffb285760",
      "text": "那真是让人浮想联翩呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d349b852bace246f7af6eaf8e77c3ae9007f7f3e5cb664153e801023ae406e1b",
      "text": "是的。我想着一定要为制作人送上一份格外特别的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff23d28bbab58e46457dd22150738668142077a182abaa9ddcf5f8ef8acd1f35",
      "text": "这类小物件里，绝对找不出完全相同的第二件纹理哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_23_5_02_046_23:5_02_046_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3191b4de50c952a6d4486c599881738ef5a2295f3385fa050ccf684099a0ec75",
      "text": "是这样吗！我会好好珍藏使用的。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
